// swarm_coordinator: a new swarm with no leader yet. The host's first pick leads, the first free resource gets a
// collector, the rest follow the leader.
// method: organise_swarm
// expect: succeeded
//   1. !assign_role d1 leader s1
//   2. !assign_role d2 collector r1
//   3. !assign_role d3 follower d1
//   4. !assign_role d4 follower d1

swarm s1
roster (d1 d2 d3 d4)
next_leader d1
free_resource 1 r1
